<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Hit / Punch</h1>
<p>Usage:
</p>
<pre> hit &lt;character&gt;
 punch &lt;character&gt;
</pre>
<p>You punch the character with your fists. This is a great way to start a fight 
with someone.
</p><p>To punch, your hands must be free: you can't while you wield a weapon. And you 
must have practiced fist fighting, the weapon skill for your fists, which most 
guilds teach. You can punch another player only when both of you have signed 
the book of blood.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre> &gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Knee</a>
 &gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Kick</a>
 &gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Elbow</a>
 &gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Kill</a>
</pre>




</div>